      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Statutory Interstate e-Way Bills, Regulatory Clearances &amp; 100% Marine Insurance for Whetre To Find Packers And Movers</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;">
	<p>When it comes to finding reliable packers and movers for your upcoming relocation, it is essential to understand the various aspects of statutory transit paperwork and risk coverage.</p>

	<p>GST e-Way Bills are electronic documents required for the transportation of goods across states in India. They ensure proper tax compliance and provide proof of the movement of goods.</p>
	<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #f59e0b22; color: #f59e0b; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">01</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Protocol 01</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Follow the guidelines provided by the Goods and Services Tax (GST) Council for creating and submitting e-Way Bills.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Protocol 02</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Make sure to provide accurate details about the sender, recipient, goods, and destination.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #3b82f622; color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">03</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Protocol 03</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Ensure that the e-Way Bills are valid for the duration of transportation and are updated if any changes occur during transit.</p>
  </div>
</div>

	<p>IBA-approved Lorry Receipts (LR/Bilty) are essential documents for moving goods through a lorry or truck. These documents ensure the safe transportation of your belongings.</p>
	<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>IBA stands for Indian Bureau of Airlines, but in the context of moving, it refers to the Insurance and Bill of Lading (BOL) regulations.</span></li>
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>IBA-approved LR/Bilty provide proof of the transportation agreement, including details like sender, recipient, goods, and transportation terms.</span></li>
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Make sure to obtain an IBA-approved LR/Bilty from the packers and movers you hire, ensuring the coverage provided meets your requirements.</span></li>
	</ul>

	<p>To fully protect your belongings during transportation, comprehensive risk coverage is essential. IRDAI (Insurance Regulatory and Development Authority of India) marine transit insurance offers 100% declared value coverage.</p>
	<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>IRDAI marine transit insurance ensures protection against accidental collision, theft, fire, and other unforeseen damages to your goods during transit.</span></li>
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>This coverage provides peace of mind by covering the declared value of your belongings.</span></li>
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>It is recommended to obtain a comprehensive insurance policy that covers the total declared value of your belongings, as opposed to a per-item coverage.</span></li>
	</ul>

	<h3>Understanding IRDAI Marine Transit Insurance</h3>
	<p>IRDAI marine transit insurance is provided by insurance companies to protect your belongings during transportation. This type of insurance ensures that you are fully covered for any damages that may occur during the relocation process.</p></div>
